 c.append(el('p','exs','Columns (any order): ID, Code, Subject, Exam, Date, Start, End (or Duration), Class/Section, Status (Cancelled), Notes. Exams are matched by ID, then Code, then Subject, so importing again never creates duplicates. Time changes are applied to the matching sections; rescheduled-date, cancelled, missing and unmatched exams are only flagged — invigilators are never removed or replaced automatically.'));
