function beep(n){try{const C=window.__ETA||(window.__ETA=new(window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)());for(let i=0;i<n;i++){const o=C.createOscillator(),g=C.createGain();o.frequency.value=880;g.gain.value=.25;o.connect(g);g.connect(C.destination);const t=C.currentTime+i*.4;o.start(t);o.stop(t+.25)}}catch(e){}}
function clockHtml(sty,H,M,S2,frac,ph){
 const D2=n=>String(n).padStart(2,'0'),txt=D2(H)+':'+D2(M)+':'+D2(S2);
 if(sty==='flip'){return '<div class="etFl">'+txt.split('').map(c=>c===':'?'<i class="etCo">:</i>':'<span class="etFc">'+c+'</span>').join('')+'</div>'}
 if(sty==='ring'){const R=46,C=2*Math.PI*R;return '<div class="etRg"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="'+R+'" class="rb"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="'+R+'" class="rf" stroke-dasharray="'+C.toFixed(1)+'" stroke-dashoffset="'+(C*(1-frac)).toFixed(1)+'" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)"/></svg><div class="etRt">'+txt+'</div></div>'}
 if(sty==='analog'){const n=new Date(Date.now()+4*36e5),hh=n.getUTCHours()%12,mm=n.getUTCMinutes(),ss=n.getUTCSeconds();
  const ha=(hh+mm/60)*30,ma=(mm+ss/60)*6,sa=ss*6;let tk='';for(let i=0;i<60;i++){const l=i%5?3:7;tk+='<line x1="50" y1="'+(5)+'" x2="50" y2="'+(5+l)+'" transform="rotate('+i*6+' 50 50)" class="tk'+(i%5?'':' bg')+'"/>'}
  return '<div class="etAn"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="48" class="fc"/>'+tk+'<line x1="50" y1="50" x2="50" y2="26" class="hh" transform="rotate('+ha+' 50 50)"/><line x1="50" y1="50" x2="50" y2="14" class="mh" transform="rotate('+ma+' 50 50)"/><line x1="50" y1="56" x2="50" y2="10" class="sh" transform="rotate('+sa+' 50 50)"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="3" class="sh2"/></svg></div>'}
 if(sty==='led'){const Mp={0:'abcdef',1:'bc',2:'abdeg',3:'abcdg',4:'bcfg',5:'acdfg',6:'acdefg',7:'abc',8:'abcdefg',9:'abcdfg'},P={a:[8,2,44,8],b:[52,10,8,36],c:[52,54,8,36],d:[8,90,44,8],e:[0,54,8,36],f:[0,10,8,36],g:[8,46,44,8]};let x=0,o='';
  for(const ch of txt){if(ch===':'){o+='<circle cx="'+(x+8)+'" cy="33" r="5" class="on"/><circle cx="'+(x+8)+'" cy="67" r="5" class="on"/>';x+=24;continue}const on=Mp[ch]||'';for(const k in P){const q=P[k];o+='<rect x="'+(x+q[0])+'" y="'+q[1]+'" width="'+q[2]+'" height="'+q[3]+'" rx="3" class="sg'+(on.includes(k)?' on':'')+'"/>'}x+=70}
  return '<div class="etLed"><svg viewBox="0 0 '+(x-10)+' 100">'+o+'</svg></div>'}
 if(sty==='neon')return '<div class="etNeon">'+txt+'</div>';
 if(sty==='arc'){const L=Math.PI*45;return '<div class="etArc"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 56"><path d="M5 50 A45 45 0 0 1 95 50" class="ab"/><path d="M5 50 A45 45 0 0 1 95 50" class="af" stroke-dasharray="'+L.toFixed(1)+'" stroke-dashoffset="'+(L*(1-frac)).toFixed(1)+'"/></svg><div class="etTx">'+txt+'</div></div>'}
 if(sty==='dots'){const on=Math.round(frac*60);let d='';for(let i=0;i<60;i++){const a=i*6*Math.PI/180;d+='<circle cx="'+(50+44*Math.sin(a)).toFixed(2)+'" cy="'+(50-44*Math.cos(a)).toFixed(2)+'" r="'+(i%5?1.5:2.4)+'" class="'+(i<on?'on':'off')+'"/>'}return '<div class="etDt"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100">'+d+'</svg><div class="etTx etTxC">'+txt+'</div></div>'}
 if(sty==='glass'){const f=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,frac));const H1=44*f,H2=44*(1-f);return '<div class="etGl"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><clipPath id="hgc"><path d="M22 6 H78 C78 30 58 40 54 50 C58 60 78 70 78 94 H22 C22 70 42 60 46 50 C42 40 22 30 22 6 Z"/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path="url(#hgc)"><rect x="0" y="'+(50-H1).toFixed(1)+'" width="100" height="'+H1.toFixed(1)+'" class="sd"/><rect x="0" y="'+(94-H2).toFixed(1)+'" width="100" height="'+H2.toFixed(1)+'" class="sd"/>'+(f>0&&f<1?'<rect x="49.2" y="48" width="1.6" height="'+(94-H2-48).toFixed(1)+'" class="sd"/>':'')+'</g><path d="M22 6 H78 C78 30 58 40 54 50 C58 60 78 70 78 94 H22 C22 70 42 60 46 50 C42 40 22 30 22 6 Z" class="go"/><rect x="18" y="2" width="64" height="5" rx="2" class="gc"/><rect x="18" y="93" width="64" height="5" rx="2" class="gc"/></svg><div class="etTx">'+txt+'</div></div>'}
 if(sty==='blocks'){const n=24,on=Math.ceil(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,frac))*n);let b='';for(let i=0;i<n;i++)b+='<i class="'+(i<on?'on':'')+'"></i>';return '<div class="etBl"><div class="etBk">'+b+'</div><div class="etTx">'+txt+'</div></div>'}
 if(sty==='minimal'){const tm=H*60+M;return '<div class="etMn"><b>'+tm+'</b><span>min</span><i>'+D2(S2)+' sec</i></div>'}
 return '<div class="etDg">'+txt+'</div>'}
function tick(){
 const c=ET.cur,s=document.getElementById('etStat'),k=document.getElementById('etClk'),p=document.getElementById('etPg'),r=document.getElementById('etBig'),tt=document.getElementById('etTt');if(!c||!s||!r)return;
 const date=ET.cd||c.d.date,fs=ET.cs||hm(c.a),fe=ET.ce||hm(c.b);
 let st=ms(date,fs),en=ms(date,fe);
 let ready=false;if(ET.prac){const dur=en-st;st=ET.prac;en=ET.prac+dur}else if(ET.hand){const dur=en-st;if(ET.hs){st=ET.hs;en=ET.hs+dur}else{ready=true;en=st+dur}}
 if(isNaN(st)||isNaN(en)||en<=st){s.textContent='Set a valid start and end time';k.textContent='--:--:--';return}
 if(tt)tt.textContent='Starts '+fs+'  ·  Ends '+fe+'  ·  '+FMT(date)+'  ·  '+((ET.cs||ET.ce||ET.cd)?'✍️ manual time':(c.WN&&c.WN.src==='final'?'🔗 final exams timetable · '+c.WN.du+' min':'🔗 invigilation plan'));
 const now=Date.now();let ph,left,txt;
 if(ready){ph='wait';left=en-st;txt='جاهز — اضغط «ابدأ» · Ready — press START'}
 else if(now<st){ph='wait';left=st-now;txt=(ET.prac?'PRACTICE · ':'')+'Exam starts in'}
 else if(now<en){left=en-now;ph=left<=5*6e4?'crit':left<=15*6e4?'warn':'run';txt=(ET.prac?'PRACTICE · ':'')+'Time remaining'}
 else{ph='end';left=0;txt='Time is up — collect the papers'}
 let idle=false;if(ph==='wait'&&!ready&&!ET.prac&&left>20*6e4){idle=true;txt='🕘 يبدأ الاختبار الساعة '+fs+' — يعمل المؤقت تلقائياً قبل البدء بـ 20 دقيقة · Exam starts at '+fs+'; the timer starts automatically 20 min before'}
 const T=Math.floor(left/1000),DN=new Date(now+4*36e5),H=idle?(+String(fs).split(':')[0]||0):Math.floor(T/3600),M=idle?(+String(fs).split(':')[1]||0):Math.floor(T%3600/60),S2=idle?0:T%60;
 const frac=ph==='wait'?0:ph==='end'?1:Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(now-st)/(en-st)));
 const rem=ph==='wait'?1:1-frac;
 const html=clockHtml(ET.style,H,M,S2,ph==='wait'?1:ph==='end'?0:1-frac,ph);
 if(k.dataset.h!==html){k.innerHTML=html;k.dataset.h=html}
 s.textContent=txt;r.dataset.ph=ph;r.classList.toggle('etKeep',!!(ET.color&&(ph==='run'||ph==='wait'||ET.keep)));
 p.firstChild.style.width=(rem*100)+'%';
 if(ET.alert){const f=ET.fired;if(ph==='warn'&&!f.w){f.w=1;beep(2)}if(ph==='crit'&&!f.c){f.c=1;beep(3)}}
 if(ET.lp==='wait'&&(ph==='run'||ph==='warn'||ph==='crit')&&!ET.fired.s){ET.fired.s=1;if(ET.alert)playSnd('bell')}
 ET.lp=ph;
 if(ph==='end'&&!ET.fired.e){ET.fired.e=1;if(ET.alert)playSnd(ET.snd||'cont10')}}
setInterval(()=>{if(document.body.classList.contains('etOpen'))tick()},500);
document.addEventListener('fullscreenchange',()=>{if(!document.fullscreenElement&&ET.full){ET.full=false;tdraw()}});
const _sv2=showView;showView=function(id){const tm=id==='etimer';if(tm)id='exam';_sv2(id);if(id==='exam'){draw();if(S.days.length)tdraw();if(tm){document.body.classList.add('etOpen');tdraw();const e=document.getElementById('etPanel');e&&(e.scrollTop=0)}}};
window.__etClose=()=>{ET.full=false;document.body.classList.remove('etOpen');try{if(document.fullscreenElement)document.exitFullscreen()}catch(e){}tdraw()};
$('etBk').onclick=window.__etClose;$('etBack').onclick=window.__etClose;addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'&&document.body.classList.contains('etOpen')&&!ET.full)window.__etClose()});
